\fs16 Three shipwrecked clonks wash ashore at a ruined colony on Colony Bay.\par
\par
Clear the rubble, restore the wood\emdash stone\emdash tools chain, then rebuild and light the lighthouse.\par
\par
The lighthouse recipe unlocks when your settlement value reaches 300.\par
\par
Light the beacon at night to attract a trade ship that brings chemistry knowledge.\par
